## 🛠️ Troubleshooting

### Common Issues

#### Port Already in Use
```bash
# Find and kill process on port
sudo lsof -i :{{ django_port }}
sudo kill -9 <PID>

# Or use the startup script
{{ deploy_root }}/start_nir_mistral.sh stop
{{ deploy_root }}/start_nir_mistral.sh start
```

#### Services Won't Start
```bash
# Check service logs
journalctl -u django -xe
journalctl -u port_agent -xe

# Check application logs
tail -f {{ deploy_root }}/logs/django.log
tail -f {{ deploy_root }}/logs/port_agent.log
```

#### Dependency Issues
```bash
# Reinstall dependencies
source {{ venv_path }}/bin/activate
pip install -r {{ django_project_path }}/requirements.txt
pip install -r {{ port_agent_path }}/requirements.txt
```

### Debug Mode

To enable debug mode:

1. Edit `{{ django_project_path }}/nir_web/settings.py`:
   ```python
   DEBUG = True
   ```

2. Restart Django:
   ```bash
   sudo systemctl restart django
   ```

